{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】旅發局今日與CoinDesk簽署策略合作備忘錄，落實旗下全球人工智能(AI)、區塊鏈及數字資產業界大型峰會Consensus，在2027年至2029年連續三年落戶香港，並以 Consensus Hong Kong 作為其亞洲旗艦盛事。</p>\n<p>有關合作將進一步鞏固香港作為國際會展之都、金融科技及創科樞紐地位，同時吸引更多高增值會展旅客訪港。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:38.073771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:12.867937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:58:37.599560+00:00","content_hash":"ce5db57659fdfa53fb180708d95dc2cd8a29086d1853255bcfd88b06809945d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:38.073771+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}